{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>&quot;Rastignac: Wastelands&quot;</strong>, a gripping survival horror experience that plunges you into a collapsing urban city consumed by <strong>a mysterious alien invasion</strong>. As one of the last survivors, you must navigate through the chaos of the quarantine zone \u2014 a place where <strong>the world itself has turned against you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>&quot;Rastignac: Wastelands&quot;</strong>, danger lurks not only in the form of <strong>relentless alien creatures</strong>, but also in the <strong>hostile environment</strong> that surrounds you. Toxic air, unstable weather, and scarce resources make every step a deadly challenge. Scavenge for supplies, fight for survival, and drive through the ruins of civilization in your desperate search for escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a post-apocalyptic urban city overrun by enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/82841807f91aa834206ce7b46f860353.poster.avif?t=1764607179\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/82841807f91aa834206ce7b46f860353.webm?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/82841807f91aa834206ce7b46f860353.mp4?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons and tools to fend off the undead and scavenge for supplies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fbd110f342e428eb175d4203bf213ec4.poster.avif?t=1764607179\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fbd110f342e428eb175d4203bf213ec4.webm?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fbd110f342e428eb175d4203bf213ec4.mp4?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through the city streets in search of safety and salvation, but beware of obstacles and ambushes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/ab87b39744d59e6afce89943f015c02e.poster.avif?t=1764607179\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/ab87b39744d59e6afce89943f015c02e.webm?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/ab87b39744d59e6afce89943f015c02e.mp4?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping story of survival and desperation as you fight to escape the quarantine zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fc397246ae1f9b916d7cc187921062c3.poster.avif?t=1764607179\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fc397246ae1f9b916d7cc187921062c3.webm?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fc397246ae1f9b916d7cc187921062c3.mp4?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rastignac The Homeless&quot; will test your courage, resourcefulness, and determination as you battle against the odds to survive in a world consumed by darkness. Are you ready to face the horrors that await and prove yourself as the ultimate survivor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its <strong>immersive atmosphere</strong>, dynamic survival mechanics, and constant sense of threat, every decision you make could mean the difference between life and death. <br>In this wasteland, <strong>the true enemy isn\u2019t just what hunts you \u2014 it\u2019s the world itself.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942520?t=1764607179","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942520?t=1764607179","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/0b0bb66ae9961ef74c107dadd4b404db4ae522e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764607179","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/0b0bb66ae9961ef74c107dadd4b404db4ae522e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764607179","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is no sexual act in the game. The game is violent by nature, ( the background of the game, the enemies ) but  is mainly related to weapons and vision of death of people."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>&quot;Rastignac: Wastelands&quot;</strong>, a gripping survival horror experience that plunges you into a collapsing urban city consumed by <strong>a mysterious alien invasion</strong>. As one of the last survivors, you must navigate through the chaos of the quarantine zone \u2014 a place where <strong>the world itself has turned against you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>&quot;Rastignac: Wastelands&quot;</strong>, danger lurks not only in the form of <strong>relentless alien creatures</strong>, but also in the <strong>hostile environment</strong> that surrounds you. Toxic air, unstable weather, and scarce resources make every step a deadly challenge. Scavenge for supplies, fight for survival, and drive through the ruins of civilization in your desperate search for escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a post-apocalyptic urban city overrun by enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/82841807f91aa834206ce7b46f860353.poster.avif?t=1764607179\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/82841807f91aa834206ce7b46f860353.webm?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/82841807f91aa834206ce7b46f860353.mp4?t=1764607179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons and tools to fend off the undead and scavenge for supplies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fbd110f342e428eb175d4203bf213ec4.poster.avif?t=1764607179\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst